    sections: [
      {
        type: 'about',
        tabLabel: 'About',
        pages: [
          {
            title: 'Boerenbridge',
            subtitle: 'The Dutch Oh Hell!',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Boerenbridge ('Farmer's Bridge') is the Dutch adaptation of the international favorite 'Oh Hell!' or 'Nomination Whist'. It is an exact-bidding trick-taking game where players must predict precisely how many tricks they will win in each round. The game is played over a series of deals where hand sizes increase and then decrease ('Up and Down the River'). Known for its strategic depth and the pressure of hitting a zero-trick bid, it is a staple of Dutch social card gaming.",
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Derived from the British game 'Nomination Whist' which gained popularity in the 1930s. The Dutch variant, Boerenbridge, introduced a structured trump rotation and specific scoring rules that became standardized in Dutch social clubs.",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '3 to 7 players playing individually.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Standard 52-card French pack (No Jokers).',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Standard pack, score pad.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'The round number (N) determines the hand size. Start at 1 card, increase by 1 each deal to a maximum (e.g., 10), then decrease back to 1. A trump card is turned after each deal.',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Variations',
            subtitle: 'Known ways this game changes',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'list',
                style: 'unordered',
                items: [
                  {
                    text: 'Fixed Trump Rotation: Trump follows a fixed order (Spades, Diamonds, Clubs, Hearts, No Trump) rather than being turned.',
                  },
                ],
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
