      difficulty: {
        easy: 'Bids based only on the count of high cards (Aces/Kings). Plays highest cards first. Does not understand the forced dealer bid.',
        medium: 'Evaluates trick probability based on trump count and hand distribution. Adjusts play to hit the exact bid.',
        hard: "Full card counter. Calculates the optimal lead to force opponents to win tricks they didn't bid for. Uses 'ducking' techniques perfectly in zero-bid rounds.",
